# Deterministic line endings on every certified development platform
# (M00-W09, spec §5.14.4, REQ-PLAT-016): all text files are committed and
# checked out with LF regardless of the host's core.autocrlf, so format
# checks, hashes, and generated-view comparisons behave identically on
# macOS, Windows, and Ubuntu. Binary content is auto-detected by Git and
# left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
